<title>USA: Monterey Homes Corp Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Monterey Homes Corp Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MONTEREY HOMES CORP. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>				Operating Results and Data</p>
<p>				    Quarter ended March 31,</p>
<p>					 1997	  1996	   1996</p>
<p>				Actual  Historical (a)  Pro Forma (b)</p>
<p>Operating Results</p>
