<p>    outstanding (c)	  4,671,173   3,273,118    4,616,455</p>
<p> Operating Data			Quarter Ended March 31,</p>
<p>					  ($'s in 000's)</p>
<p>				 1997		     1996</p>
<p>			   Units	   's  Units (b)	 's (b)</p>
