<p>(a) The historical amounts do not reflect any of Monterey Homes' operations for 1996, as the merger between Homeplex Mortgage Investments Corp. and Monterey Homes occurred on Dec.</p>
<p>31, 1996. (b) The pro forma amounts reflect the operating results as if the merger of Homplex Mortgage Investments Corp.</p>
<p>with Monterey Homes had occurred at the beginning of 1996. (c) Adjusted for a 1-for-3 reverse stock split which occurred on Dec. 31, 1996.</p>
